@startuml UC-28 Edit Own Blog Comment - Sequence Diagram (stereo)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280

actor Teacher
participant ":BlogCommunityPage" as UI <<user interaction>>
participant ":BlogController" as CTL <<coordinator>>
participant ":BlogCommentService" as SVC <<business logic>>
participant ":BlogCommentRepository" as REPO <<interface>>
database DB

autonumber
activate Teacher
Teacher ->> UI : Click "Edit" on one of their own comments
activate UI
UI ->> UI : startEditComment(comment)
UI -->> Teacher : Show the comment in inline edit mode with its current text
Teacher ->> UI : Edit the comment text and click "Save"
UI ->> UI : requestUpdateComment()
UI -->> Teacher : Show the save confirmation dialog
Teacher ->> UI : Click "Save changes" to confirm
UI ->> UI : updateComment()
UI ->> CTL : PATCH /api/blog-comments/{commentId}
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : update(commentId, content)
activate SVC

SVC ->> REPO : findById(commentId)
activate REPO
REPO ->> DB : SELECT * FROM blog_comments WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> REPO : row / none
deactivate DB
REPO -->> SVC : BlogComment
deactivate REPO

alt the comment is missing or hidden, the teacher is not its author, or the new text is empty or over 200 words
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / ForbiddenOperationException / IllegalArgumentException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 404 / 403 / 400
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG25 and keep the edited text in the inline editor

else the teacher owns the comment and the new text is valid
  SVC ->> SVC : sanitize the new text, keep createdAt and set updatedAt to now
  SVC ->> REPO : save(comment)
  activate REPO
  REPO ->> DB : UPDATE blog_comments SET content = ?, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> REPO : Saved
  deactivate DB
  REPO -->> SVC : BlogComment
  deactivate REPO
  SVC -->> CTL : CommentView
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 200 + CommentView
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG08, reload the discussion and display the updated comment
end

deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
deactivate Teacher
@enduml
